// Installed name: TEST - Jelly Repeat Capture
// Purpose/role: Isolate production repeat-result capture candidate; diagnostic.
// Specification revision: 1; interface: 1.0.
// Input: Ignored, including absent input. Output: Inspect Alpha/Beta list in editor.
// Direct/called: Same two iterations; no explicit return contract or prompts.
// Side effects: None. Dependencies: None. No permissions/provider apps.
// Target: iPadOS 26.6, Jellycuts 2026.6.4; bundled compiler unknown.
// Evidence: Pinned compiler/project candidate; legacy guide differs.
// Stage: Drafted. Tests and evidence: README.md; not compiled/imported/run.

import Shortcuts

list(items: ["Alpha", "Beta"]) >> options
repeatEach options {
    text(text: "${RepeatItem}")
} >> capturedItems
